<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF A MENS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF A MENS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>SHIGA KOGEN, Japan 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
